list.item:
 Inouye, Daniel K., Senator (D—Hawaii);
Chairman of the Senate Select Committee on Intelligence until
January 1979

person.note:
Deputy Director of Central Intelligence from July 1976 until August 1977;
                    Acting Director of Central Intelligence from January 1977 until March
                    1977

Director of the Bureau of Intelligence and Research until April 1978;
                    thereafter Assistant Secretary of State for Near Eastern and South Asian
                    Affairs
